WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.280
So tell us a secret, how do you sell all the leads?

00:02.280 --> 00:04.200
You gotta go right away, you gotta call them instantly.

00:04.200 --> 00:05.800
The only ones I don't call is the ones I click on

00:05.800 --> 00:07.080
at one o'clock in the morning, you know.

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
Calling them right away, getting on the phone call,

00:08.920 --> 00:09.760
going out there, you know,

00:09.760 --> 00:11.520
setting up your appointment as soon as possible.

00:11.520 --> 00:13.000
That's been the trick for me forever,

00:13.000 --> 00:14.840
being there right away, calling back right away.

00:14.840 --> 00:17.360
Saturday was 9.30, I got a click, got on the phone,

00:17.360 --> 00:19.200
we were on the phone for about maybe,

00:19.200 --> 00:20.960
I think I checked those 54 minutes,

00:20.960 --> 00:23.560
set up an appointment for this week for a new construction.

